{
 "feature": "Skill without cooldown",
 "notes": "Two layers: (a) HeroControl.allSkillCooldown float[] @0xF0 is the live per-slot cooldown timer array — zeroing it each frame (or hooking UpdateSkillsCooldown) gives no-cooldown. (b) EC2HeroSkill (ScriptableObject) holds baseCooldown @0x24 / cooldown @0x3C / runningCooldown @0x48 — hook ApplyCooldown/GetFinalCooldown to return 0. CanUseSkill is the gate: hooking it to always return true also bypasses mana checks. Preferred: hook HeroControl.UpdateSkillsCooldown (0x2766164) — single choke point for all 4 skill slots.",
